/**
 * Central registry for the Kivuko photo set.
 *
 * Every photo exposes:
 *   src    — the original source JPEG (kept as the reference asset and as
 *            the fallback <img src> for browsers without srcSet support)
 *   webp   — responsive WebP derivatives, ascending by width, generated by
 *            `scripts/generate-webp.mjs` (run once, committed to the repo)
 *   width / height — the source photo's intrinsic dimensions
 *
 * Usage sites pick which width the browser downloads via the `sizes`
 * attribute; nothing here depends on a runtime image library.
 */
